<title>HONG KONG: HK Daily News interim loss at HK$41.7 mln.</title>
<headline>HK Daily News interim loss at HK$41.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   13.19 loss vs 8.28 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.96 loss  vs 0.83 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    41.74 loss vs 22.07 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     274.14     vs 374.55</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hong Kong Daily News Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong Daily News is a printer and newspaper publisher.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss represents provision for advances and accrued interest receivable due from a director of a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
